==English==
[[File:Bucephala clangula (cropped).jpg|thumb|a '''common goldeneye''' seaduck, ''Bucephala clangula'']]
[[File:Chrysopa perla 02.jpg|thumb|a green lacewing or '''goldeneye''', ''Chrysopa perla'']]
[[File:Showy Goldeneye (8950887020).jpg|thumb|'''showy goldeneye''' flowers, ''Heliomeris multiflora'']]

===Etymology===
From {{compound|en|golden|eye}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈɡəʊldənaɪ/|a=UK}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Any of several [[seaduck]]s, of the [[genus]] {{taxfmt|Bucephala|genus}}, having black and white [[plumage]].
# Any of several [[lacewing]]s of the [[family]] {{taxfmt|Chrysopidae|family}}.
# Any of several flowering plants of the [[subtribe]] {{taxfmt|Helianthinae|subtribe}}.

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|seaduck}} {{l|en|whistler}}
* {{sense|fly}} [[green lacewing]]

====Derived terms====
* {{l|en|Barrow's goldeneye}}, {{taxfmt|Bucephala islandica|species}}
* {{l|en|common goldeneye}}, {{taxfmt|Bucephala clangula|species}}

